16zg|n|The hard, white, opaque, fine-grained substance constituting the tusks of the elephant. It is a variety of dentine, characterized by the minuteness and close arrangement of the tubes, as also by their double flexure. It is used in manufacturing articles of ornament or utility. ; The tusks themselves of the elephant, etc. ; Any carving executed in ivory. ; Teeth; as, to show one's ivories.	a:fj,42,8~fj,42,8	N:2a06,139,104;2a09,116,9~2a06,139,104;2a09,116,9
