16zi|n|A plant of the genus Hedera (H. helix), common in Europe. Its leaves are evergreen, dark, smooth, shining, and mostly five-pointed; the flowers yellowish and small; the berries black or yellow. The stem clings to walls and trees by rootlike fibers.	a:1s28,44,8;zz,41,7;1jjn,7,8~1jjn,7,8;1s28,44,8;zz,41,7	V:199t,92,1;199p,88,7~199p,88,7;199t,92,1	N:199p,144,327;199t,132,17;2cy7,13,5~199p,144,327;199t,132,17;2cy7,13,5
